  "steps": [
    "Preheat the oven to 425°F and line a large baking sheet with parchment.",
    "Spread the tater tots on the sheet and bake for 15 min.",
    "Take the pan out and smash each tot into a flat disc with the bottom of a cup. Bake another 20 min, until deep golden brown and crispy.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk the yogurt, mayonnaise, mustard, lemon juice, pickle juice, dill, garlic, salt, pepper, garlic powder, onion powder and red pepper flakes.",
    "Add the hot tots and toss gently to coat, then fold in the cucumber, pickles and scallions. Serve right away while the tots are crisp."
